  "REQ GET https://management.example.test/subscriptions/sub-test/resourceGroups/id1%2F%20x/providers/Microsoft.AppConfiguration/configurationStores/id2%2F%20x/replicas?%24skipToken=s-skiptoken&api-version=2024-06-01",
